            <ArticleTitle>Radiation-induced accelerated coronary arteriosclerosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>183-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is a paucity of information on radiation-induced coronary heart disease. A young patient with myocardial infarction following mediastinal irradiation is described. The role of radiotherapy and chemotherapy on the subsequent development of coronary heart disease is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
